# Break: boots, finds the card (tools/make_test_card.py -> emu-card), loads
# bank 1 sample 1 and plays it; J7 clocks eighths, J8 fires on kick slices.
# (`print rms` consumes the window, so every expect comes before a print.)
pot 1 0
pot 2 0
pot 3 0
pot 4 0.5
pot 5 0
pot 6 0.5
wait 3000
expect booted
expect led b1 green        # playing a loaded break
mark
wait 2000
expect rms > 0.01          # the break plays with nothing patched in
expect edges 7 > 6         # clock out: 8 eighths in 2 s at 120 BPM
expect edges 7 < 10
expect edges 8 > 0         # trig out: kick slices (Settings default)
expect finite
expect unclipped
print cv
